1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,132
Welcome to the Early Game Pipeline operational training.

2
00:00:04,132 --> 00:00:08,117
In Module 1, we cover the prospect experience.

3
00:00:08,117 --> 00:00:18,779
When a prospect like Kevin Smith visits the Octane booking page, he is presented with clear expectations of the thirty-minute pre-screen format before booking.

4
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:24,705
Kevin selects a reason to meet us from the dropdown, then Kevin selects a time slot.

5
00:00:24,705 --> 00:00:29,632
The calendar automatically routes the meeting to the active representative.

6
00:00:29,632 --> 00:00:41,941
Kevin completes the seven-point intake form, providing his role at Meridian Logistics, his service track interest, and his direct contact details, before submitting the request.

